        "title": "Option<P> Scene impl doesn't forward register_dependencies",
        "explanation": "The tuple impls override both resolve and register_dependencies, but the new Option<P> impl only implements resolve. The trait default for register_dependencies is a no-op, so a Some(scene) that depends on assets will not register them. With queue_spawn_scene the scene won't wait for those assets, and resolve can fail with MissingSceneDependency.",
        "suggestion": "Add `fn register_dependencies(&self, dependencies: &mut SceneDependencies) { if let Some(scene) = self { scene.register_dependencies(dependencies); } }`.",
